# 🧹 Retail Sales Dataset Cleaning Using Python

## 📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on cleaning and preprocessing a messy retail sales dataset using Python. The main objective is to identify and handle missing values, duplicate records, inconsistent data formats, invalid entries, and outliers to improve data quality and prepare the dataset for further analysis.

This project is completed as part of the **Oasis Infobyte Internship (OIBSIP) – Data Analytics Task 2: Data Cleaning**.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- Understand and inspect the messy retail sales dataset.
- Identify missing values and duplicate records.
- Detect invalid and inconsistent data entries.
- Handle missing values using appropriate imputation techniques.
- Remove duplicate records.
- Standardize categorical data.
- Convert columns into appropriate data types.
- Detect and handle outliers.
- Export the cleaned dataset into a CSV file.

## 📂 Dataset Information

**Dataset Name:** `messy_retail_sales_dataset.csv`

